            "name": "Biglands: A Game Made By Kids",
            "steam_appid": 316740,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Embark on an epic adventure through unknown lands on a quest to save the world! <br />\r\nFight your way through hordes of enemies!<br />\r\nNavigate through perilous obstacles!<br />\r\nCollect tons of items!<br />\r\nBuild and upgrade your weapons!<br />\r\nPrepare for monstrous bosses!<br />\r\nAll from the imagination and creativity of kids!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n** Play with a GAME CONTROLLER, TOUCHSCREEN controls, or KEYBOARD and MOUSE **<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is a gift to my nephews. They came up with the name, story and gameplay. The characters, weapons, enemies, bosses, fonts, some levels and many other miscellaneous objects were collected from their old drawings, which can be viewed by collecting the concept art throughout the game.",
            "about_the_game": "Embark on an epic adventure through unknown lands on a quest to save the world! <br />\r\nFight your way through hordes of enemies!<br />\r\nNavigate through perilous obstacles!<br />\r\nCollect tons of items!<br />\r\nBuild and upgrade your weapons!<br />\r\nPrepare for monstrous bosses!<br />\r\nAll from the imagination and creativity of kids!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n** Play with a GAME CONTROLLER, TOUCHSCREEN controls, or KEYBOARD and MOUSE **<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is a gift to my nephews. They came up with the name, story and gameplay. The characters, weapons, enemies, bosses, fonts, some levels and many other miscellaneous objects were collected from their old drawings, which can be viewed by collecting the concept art throughout the game.",
            "short_description": "A challenging RPG platformer adventure all from the imagination and creativity of kids!",
